# The dev container image only needs `lean-toolchain` and `lake-manifest.json`, but the
# build context is the whole repository. Once the game has been built once, `.lake/`
# holds mathlib and its build artifacts (several GB), which would otherwise be sent to
# the docker daemon on every rebuild. Keep the context small.
.lake/
lake-packages/
build/
node_modules/
.git/
.i18n/**/*.mo
**/.DS_Store
